<title>USA: Radnor Holdings Inc sells $100 mln in junk debt.</title>
<headline>Radnor Holdings Inc sells $100 mln in junk debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Radnor Holdings Inc was priced on Tuesday. Alex Brown &amp; Sons served as lead manager for the 144a deal, market sources say.</p>
<p>BORROWER: RADNOR HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10 PCT     MATURITY 12/1/03</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 6/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10 PCT	PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P DOUBLE-B  SPREAD 398 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FOUR YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
